msgid "⟪k:0⟫In retrospect, I’m sure they knew where we were going, and just let us do our thing."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ripensandoci, sono certa che sapessero dove stavamo andando,⟪k:1⟫e che ci lasciassero fare."

#: scenario3:scenario3_98FB91E2_F439_41A4_B8A7_8B97EB96BFE6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e07b9a1ef6442b48d3be76922b1aad25ecf74bd7af0ea2f6db0ffabe4f9a8e87
#. default-sha256: 44510155bbca60b051a744df5c8179d9b9cfc7e5da7ddf67d951a30349ba5f1c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_98FB91E2_F439_41A4_B8A7_8B97EB96BFE6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Oh yeah, there was this one time we were playing and a huge storm rolled in, trapping us up "
"there."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ah già, ricordi quella volta in cui stavamo giocando ed era arrivata quella grossa tempesta?"
"⟪k:1⟫ Rimanemmo intrappolati lassù quella notte."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A08454AA_660C_4D48_896F_E734565DB339
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ba5bb568af51ea9b5791d843a19e822c0076e7232b44e7e5922caeb388e68a00
#. default-sha256: fe840b4a17fa672633d69ad9afd9eb61ee149f8eb0fe71770ef8d44207330e27
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A08454AA_660C_4D48_896F_E734565DB339"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The wind wasn’t just howling—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫it was screaming bloody murder."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Il vento non stava solo ululando—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫stava urlando a squarciagola."

#: scenario3:scenario3_E07DA6DF_8CAA_4E0E_8AC4_ED032E67AC78
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 644f88940f6d92831ddbe295ad02ff9ce8a5acb2c2356d03bd14886c265c76cf
#. default-sha256: 2def89ae87383164bd41151890e86b30393736896f3f1d5a142cda8cf85f9ce9
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_E07DA6DF_8CAA_4E0E_8AC4_ED032E67AC78"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was blowing so hard I thought the house might fly away.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫As I recall, you were "
"crying that night."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Soffiava così forte che pensavo che la casa sarebbe volata via.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ricordo che "
"piangesti quella volta."

#: scenario3:scenario3_CE4A3EE0_25B3_4F1F_8B23_A9526C4A583C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d8cc5ec2461c72bcb6a004efd0a4a2dba10fa0909bb33d993daddbdfd75b1080
#. default-sha256: fbba4736614ef0c4d6d2e1271b80273aca9074cc5124d32f483aa0340a95fdfa
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_CE4A3EE0_25B3_4F1F_8B23_A9526C4A583C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Hey, Nero! You here to see me off too?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ehi, Nero! Sei venuto a salutarmi anche tu?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_86BCCEFB_2D58_44BF_B3F9_DFF7B355BFA9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a6137ff38a925d7bd2cb7e16a2a0d985ae6aae59ba62070721b53f7342b33225
#. default-sha256: 2c5502c1d39e7c5371561438f091a03594281271aec081d0a53e00903280f05b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_86BCCEFB_2D58_44BF_B3F9_DFF7B355BFA9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Aaaah, there you go wagging your tail with that dumb look on your face. ⟪k:2⟫You have "
"no idea what’s going on, do you?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Aaaah, ecco che inizi a scondinzolare con quella faccia da ebete.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Non hai la "
"più pallida idea di cosa stia succedendo, vero?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_7E6688E5_CE53_43F7_9254_18DD8DC8ED88
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7c06148893c45b01c71dc1f750921312a02a3a9075ae019524064237a16cc802
#. default-sha256: 1a3d21c6d07af528994cd5c6cf556009fde05a204a7c6954c5765730df31706f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7E6688E5_CE53_43F7_9254_18DD8DC8ED88"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It wasn’t just the two of us who had made Casa Nostra our home base, though. ⟪k:1⟫There was "
"one more—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫a stray, black dog."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non eravamo solo noi due ad aver fatto di Casa Nostra il nostro quartier generale. ⟪k:1⟫"
"C’era qualcun altro—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫un cane randagio nero."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C60A5C6E_4397_4583_8C53_FDF14A32F11D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 87c50aec56d92acfae05e6f4b2fd5db596ae603f9722b80d98c05f79d4882f3a
#. default-sha256: b8afb5f2338828794282183b15fa1a115e114b15de3d2cbf075edbcd7d675a1c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C60A5C6E_4397_4583_8C53_FDF14A32F11D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I’m pretty sure it didn’t have actually black fur, though, and it was just really, really "
"dirty."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma sono piuttosto sicura che non avesse realmente il pelo nero,⟪k:1⟫ma che fosse "
"semplicemente molto, molto sporco."

#: scenario3:scenario3_059B0B2F_D311_4652_A270_0198AD051606
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a618f4540c4b552da97bb12cdec81d1965197d66616eeb4edd2820facd76ccc2
