msgid "⟪k:0⟫Of course he doesn’t.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫He’s a stupid animal."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫È⟪k:2⟫ ovvio che non lo capisce.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫È⟪k:6⟫ solo uno stupido animale."

#: scenario3:scenario3_36970D02_8361_4FF3_BD00_DA24A2B438B4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a27f39b777a668b7f1a0913a6d9570caea5f20f95d4ddce2fea3921224f08173
