msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_38472D22_E780_41D9_B399_0C20CD8CA8DD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Besides, you’re here, so it’ll be fine!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You take care of Nero, all right?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E poi, qui ci sei tu, starà benone!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ti prenderai cura tu di Nero, okay?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_0F4F8B09_6C5A_490B_9EF3_FFFD04D7C347
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2139becfce08093635cb0a700300077e73c575bb9022bd409ab6f4cdd33e333a
