msgid "⟪k:0⟫He doesn’t like me.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You’re the only one who ⟪k:3⟫can⟪k:4⟫ take care of him."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Io non gli piaccio.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Tu sei l’unica che può prendersi cura di lui."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C5DF990B_B101_4DA6_89BE_EC5024BB7C54
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8caf5e125c833b9c412c765d85ae2ffcba80745c6a12ff372687bad537c57931
