msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Maybe so, but I’m not coming back.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫He’ll starve to death if you don’t figure "
"something out."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Probabile, ma non tornerò.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Morirà di fame se non ti inventi qualcosa."

#: scenario3:scenario3_B51B6665_8779_4240_8732_DE8B2765CC51
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e30e5c36ec56a2ec2deaf72ff3a608f3a368749db7c9e55f094bc03f4f04e8ae
