msgid "⟪k:0⟫Are you absolutely never returning to this town?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Davvero non tornerai mai più qui?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_C6AB9DBD_DA31_4922_B89D_C3B382A55377
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 06242d682e59f884e23f5ba0bed5aa2861bcb812442051059bfba5625901f8fc
